[0.000, "o", "    max abs error = 1.91e-06, mean energy-scaled error = 3.5e-07, analytic bound eps*N*max|x| ~= 4.61e-06\r\n  ok:   error within analytic bound\r\n[2] boundaries never break: push granularity independence\r\n"]
